        {
          "id": "944b6461-c2bb-3ef5-adc9-14158bc0b925",
          "content": {
            "id": "944b6461-c2bb-3ef5-adc9-14158bc0b925",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Big bank earnings, Fed commentary: What to Watch",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination Overtime host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> previews several of the biggest stories to come in the week ahead, including corporate earnings from a variety of companies like major banks JPMorgan (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JPM\">JPM</a>), Wells Fargo (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WFC\">WFC</a>), Goldman Sachs (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GS\">GS</a>), Citi (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/C\">C</a>), Bank of America (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BAC\">BAC</a>), and Morgan Stanley (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MS\">MS</a>); a slew of commentary from Federal Reserve officials; and the US Bureau of Labor Statistics (BLS) <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/bls-bringing-staff-back-sept-133142932.html\">working to have September's Consumer Price Index (CPI) inflation data ready</a> by October 24.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Market Domination Overtime host Josh Lipton previews several of the biggest stories to come in the week ahead, including corporate earnings from a variety of companies like major banks JPMorgan (JPM), Wells Fargo (WFC), Goldman Sachs (GS), Citi (C), Bank of America (BAC), and Morgan Stanley (MS); a slew of commentary from Federal Reserve officials; and the US Bureau of Labor Statistics (BLS) working to have September's Consumer Price Index (CPI) inflation data ready by October 24. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination Overtime.",
